WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:10.077
Can you count the baby bears?

2
00:00:10.078 --> 00:00:12.108
One.

3
00:00:12.109 --> 00:00:14.236
One cub.

4
00:00:14.237 --> 00:00:18.351
Can you count the baby owls?

5
00:00:18.352 --> 00:00:22.744
One, two.

6
00:00:22.745 --> 00:00:25.268
Two owlets.

7
00:00:25.269 --> 00:00:29.250
Can you count the baby cows?

8
00:00:29.251 --> 00:00:34.126
One, two, three.

9
00:00:34.127 --> 00:00:36.720
Three calves.

10
00:00:36.721 --> 00:00:40.482
Can you count the baby ducks?

11
00:00:40.483 --> 00:00:46.442
One, two, three, four.

12
00:00:46.443 --> 00:00:49.273
Four ducklings.

13
00:00:49.274 --> 00:00:53.057
Can you count the baby frogs?

14
00:00:53.058 --> 00:01:00.549
One, two, three, four, five.

15
00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:03.264
Five tadpoles.

16
00:01:03.265 --> 00:01:07.275
Can you count the baby cats?

17
00:01:07.276 --> 00:01:16.092
One, two, three, four, five, six.

18
00:01:16.093 --> 00:01:18.859
Six kittens.

19
00:01:18.860 --> 00:01:22.504
Can you count the baby sheep?

20
00:01:22.505 --> 00:01:33.003
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven.

21
00:01:33.004 --> 00:01:36.196
Seven lambs.

22
00:01:36.197 --> 00:01:39.898
Can you count the baby dogs?

23
00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:51.456
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight.

24
00:01:51.457 --> 00:01:54.132
Eight puppies.

25
00:01:54.133 --> 00:01:57.443
Can you count the baby pigs?

26
00:01:57.444 --> 00:02:10.680
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight, nine.

27
00:02:10.681 --> 00:02:13.144
Nine piglets.

28
00:02:13.145 --> 00:02:16.838
Can you count the baby chickens?

29
00:02:16.839 --> 00:02:31.074
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight, nine, ten.

30
00:02:31.075 --> 00:02:33.394
Ten chicks.

31
00:02:33.407 --> 00:02:38.717
You can count very well.
